#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""odin3d — AYN Odin 3 (Snapdragon 8 Elite / SM8750) Platform & Fan Daemon.

Provides:
  - Dynamic temperature-based fan curves (Silent, Balanced, Turbo) with hysteresis & smoothing
  - Thermal runaway protection: 88°C critical override to 100% fan speed
  - Failsafe fan speed if daemon stops or crashes
  - CPU frequency scaling management (schedutil governor default, rate_limit tuning)
  - GPU devfreq tuning (16ms polling interval, clock range per profile)
  - Stick ring RGB LED control and profile indication
  - Socket and state interface for CLI (odin3ctl) and Decky plugins

Config: /etc/odin3.conf
State:  /var/lib/odin3/state.json
Socket: /run/odin3/request
"""

